WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.685
Guide eight: saying yes to publish

2
00:00:02.685 --> 00:00:04.238
and autopilot.

3
00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.806
When a video is finished, it shows

4
00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.510
up here, under Needs you.

5
00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:10.913
Nothing goes live without your yes.

6
00:00:11.513 --> 00:00:12.966
Want to check it first?

7
00:00:12.966 --> 00:00:14.375
Click Watch it first.

8
00:00:14.975 --> 00:00:16.609
Happy with it?

9
00:00:16.609 --> 00:00:18.830
Click Yes, upload it.

10
00:00:19.430 --> 00:00:21.033
Your yes is recorded.

11
00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:22.479
Next time you talk to your

12
00:00:22.479 --> 00:00:24.149
assistant, it fills in YouTube

13
00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:26.041
Studio in your own browser, checks

14
00:00:26.041 --> 00:00:28.044
it, and asks you once more before it

15
00:00:28.044 --> 00:00:29.084
publishes.

16
00:00:29.684 --> 00:00:31.661
Autopilot makes your videos on its

17
00:00:31.661 --> 00:00:33.594
own every day, under a weekly money

18
00:00:33.594 --> 00:00:34.753
limit you pick.

19
00:00:34.753 --> 00:00:36.575
This card shows what's spent, and

20
00:00:36.575 --> 00:00:37.719
what's left.

21
00:00:38.319 --> 00:00:40.670
To turn it on, tell your assistant:

22
00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:42.091
turn on autopilot.

23
00:00:42.091 --> 00:00:43.868
It asks four quick choices:

24
00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:45.764
your weekly limit, the reset day

25
00:00:45.764 --> 00:00:47.868
the time, and phone alerts.

26
00:00:48.468 --> 00:00:49.949
Need more this week?

27
00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:51.754
Click plus five, plus ten, or plus

28
00:00:51.754 --> 00:00:53.134
twenty-five dollars.

29
00:00:53.134 --> 00:00:54.886
It asks you to confirm first, and

30
00:00:54.886 --> 00:00:56.947
the limit resets every Monday.

31
00:00:57.547 --> 00:00:59.365
Click Pause to stop autopilot any

32
00:00:59.365 --> 00:01:01.187
time. It also stops and asks you if

33
00:01:01.187 --> 00:01:03.061
a video would go over your limit, or

34
00:01:03.061 --> 00:01:04.928
if anything needs your eye.

35
00:01:05.528 --> 00:01:07.332
That's the whole loop.

36
00:01:07.332 --> 00:01:09.340
Tick your topics, check the video

37
00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:10.585
and say yes.
